Just a brief aside, to set your mind at ease. You may be concerned about the number of parallel threads in this story, even in this chapter, and how they may ever be resolved, tied up, woven together rather than tangled or frayed. You may feel that the cast of characters is growing faster than you can arrange them on stage in the theater of your mind. You may feel like a rider on a rollercoaster that keeps click-clacking ever higher until you’re not sure you can handle the ride down. Well anyway, back to the story.[@ The other two authors are loving this paragraph. ~C]

